{"4828060": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Fall, Fall, Fall for you", "steam_appid": 4828060, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [5118880], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fall, Fall, Fall for you</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Dummy, a hopelessly clumsy boy who always tries to act cool. He's finally confessing his love to Daisy—but before she'll give him an answer, she asks for the impossible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&quot;Bring me that blue star in the sky. Then give it to me~&quot;</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4828060/extras/9f93227a279156d5c4d0f464c4ab5dee.avif?t=1788345095\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4828060/extras_big/9f93227a279156d5c4d0f464c4ab5dee.webp?t=1788345095 width=1560 height=373 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&quot;I LIKE YOU, DAISYYY!!&quot;</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4828060/extras/5672fde55eedeb447091fb054feba5f1.avif?t=1788345095\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4828060/extras_big/5672fde55eedeb447091fb054feba5f1.webp?t=1788345095 width=1560 height=373 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Easy to control</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play using only your mouse to jump around as Dummy. It's as simple as that.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4828060/extras/f5d7c6f0b77967a92615dae5a2488337.poster.avif?t=1788345095\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4828060/extras/f5d7c6f0b77967a92615dae5a2488337.webm?t=1788345095\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4828060/extras/f5d7c6f0b77967a92615dae5a2488337.mp4?t=1788345095\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Reach for the Blue Star</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;The star is so faaar away!&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Starting from the tree where you first met Daisy, overcome every obstacle. Climb the giant tree, then keep ascending toward the sky!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4828060/extras/d1753986317cbc06fbc9d10aeced7dc0.poster.avif?t=1788345095\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4828060/extras/d1753986317cbc06fbc9d10aeced7dc0.webm?t=1788345095\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4828060/extras/d1753986317cbc06fbc9d10aeced7dc0.mp4?t=1788345095\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >No checkpoints, if you fall I will laugh at you.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;I'm a really kind girl. I'll always save your game, even if you lose all your progress by falling. So don't fall, okay?&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4828060/extras/e01cecc2e1a6d188f98dac0cc07e2214.poster.avif?t=1788345095\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4828060/extras/e01cecc2e1a6d188f98dac0cc07e2214.webm?t=1788345095\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4828060/extras/e01cecc2e1a6d188f98dac0cc07e2214.mp4?t=1788345095\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Full Voice Acting is available</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;I can speak English and Indonesian. Which one do you prefer?&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4828060/extras/08f2d2aeacf74ee8586211008fe29a00.poster.avif?t=1788345095\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4828060/extras/08f2d2aeacf74ee8586211008fe29a00.webm?t=1788345095\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4828060/extras/08f2d2aeacf74ee8586211008fe29a00.mp4?t=1788345095\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiple Languages</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Subtitles available in:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >English</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bahasa Indonesia</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Japanese</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chinese (Simplified)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Portuguese (Brazil)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spanish (Spain)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >9 Unique Endings</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Will you bring the star to me, or will you choose another path? Whatever you choose, I might like you... or I might get mad at you!&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4828060/extras/3e8b2870dae87d306fc444b80fb1fa8d.avif?t=1788345095\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4828060/extras_big/3e8b2870dae87d306fc444b80fb1fa8d.avif?t=1788345095 width=1560 height=620 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&quot;So... will you keep falling until you give up? Or what?&quot;</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4828060/extras/c65258f6bdefbf30884e7403a9d854ee.avif?t=1788345095\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4828060/extras_big/c65258f6bdefbf30884e7403a9d854ee.webp?t=1788345095 width=1560 height=373 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fall, Fall, Fall for you</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Dummy, a hopelessly clumsy boy who always tries to act cool. He's finally confessing his love to Daisy—but before she'll give him an answer, she asks for the impossible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&quot;Bring me that blue star in the sky. Then give it to me~&quot;</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4828060/extras/9f93227a279156d5c4d0f464c4ab5dee.avif?t=1788345095\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4828060/extras_big/9f93227a279156d5c4d0f464c4ab5dee.webp?t=1788345095 width=1560 height=373 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&quot;I LIKE YOU, DAISYYY!!&quot;</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4828060/extras/5672fde55eedeb447091fb054feba5f1.avif?t=1788345095\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4828060/extras_big/5672fde55eedeb447091fb054feba5f1.webp?t=1788345095 width=1560 height=373 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Easy to control</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play using only your mouse to jump around as Dummy. It's as simple as that.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4828060/extras/f5d7c6f0b77967a92615dae5a2488337.poster.avif?t=1788345095\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4828060/extras/f5d7c6f0b77967a92615dae5a2488337.webm?t=1788345095\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4828060/extras/f5d7c6f0b77967a92615dae5a2488337.mp4?t=1788345095\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Reach for the Blue Star</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;The star is so faaar away!&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Starting from the tree where you first met Daisy, overcome every obstacle. Climb the giant tree, then keep ascending toward the sky!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4828060/extras/d1753986317cbc06fbc9d10aeced7dc0.poster.avif?t=1788345095\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4828060/extras/d1753986317cbc06fbc9d10aeced7dc0.webm?t=1788345095\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4828060/extras/d1753986317cbc06fbc9d10aeced7dc0.mp4?t=1788345095\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >No checkpoints, if you fall I will laugh at you.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;I'm a really kind girl. I'll always save your game, even if you lose all your progress by falling. So don't fall, okay?&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4828060/extras/e01cecc2e1a6d188f98dac0cc07e2214.poster.avif?t=1788345095\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4828060/extras/e01cecc2e1a6d188f98dac0cc07e2214.webm?t=1788345095\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4828060/extras/e01cecc2e1a6d188f98dac0cc07e2214.mp4?t=1788345095\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Full Voice Acting is available</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;I can speak English and Indonesian. Which one do you prefer?&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4828060/extras/08f2d2aeacf74ee8586211008fe29a00.poster.avif?t=1788345095\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4828060/extras/08f2d2aeacf74ee8586211008fe29a00.webm?t=1788345095\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4828060/extras/08f2d2aeacf74ee8586211008fe29a00.mp4?t=1788345095\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiple Languages</h2><p class=\"bb_para